{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they","id":1463381,"title":"18 And Under Embraces: How Frequent Are They?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-10-10T21:25:08-07:00","id":1463381,"title":"18 And Under Embraces: How Frequent Are They?","content":"As the title says. How frequent are they and do they have a higher attrition rate than those embraced in adulthood?<br /> <br /> I would assume that the Anarchs probably have more 18 and under embraces, but considering the suicide rate is higher in the Anarchs I don't imagine they survive long without their sire or other mentor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T00:10:19-07:00","id":1463385,"title":"","content":"I can't really give you numbers, but I'd say reasonably rare. They tend to happen either as mistakes or Embraces of passion, such as foolish kindred Embracing their touchstones or mortal children. Both are demonstrably bad ideas, often dispatched by their Sires themselves or by whoever passes as the executioner of a given city.<br /> <br /> Many Camarilla domains rule such Embraces as outright illegal, given how such Kindred often have a lot of trouble integrating into vampiric society, mostly because they stay forever locked in a rather unstable adolescent mindset, prone to drama and overreactions, which obviously puts a strain on the Masquerade. Imagine having a teenage son/daughter in the throes of puberty, but knowing that they will never grow out of it. Not worth it for most humane Sires, and watching it unfold is likely to give you stains anyway. <br /> <br /> The only reason it would be more frequent in Anarch domains is because they are less tightly controlled and regulated, but they should face much the same issues as stated above, with an even bigger potential for violent fallout. <br /> <br /> Interestingly, I'd say the largest population of vampiric adolescents might be in the Sabbat, both because they care less about who they Embrace in general and because certain Paths, namely the Cathari, might consider it a good bit of fun. What's more, young minds tend to be more malleable to Path indoctrination, and as a result, adolescent Cainites might actually thrive to some degree.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4234,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4234-bodhiofur","user":"BodhiofUr","date":". 10-11-2021, 03:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4234-bodhiofur","name":"BodhiofUr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T01:19:01-07:00","id":1463388,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>omenseer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they#post1463381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As the title says. How frequent are they and do they have a higher attrition rate than those embraced in adulthood?<br /> <br /> I would assume that the Anarchs probably have more 18 and under embraces, but considering the suicide rate is higher in the Anarchs I don't imagine they survive long without their sire or other mentor.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, depends on the reasoning but I imagine it goes like this:<br /> <br /> 1:] <b>Sabbat</b>: Yes, the Sabbat will Embrace children and fully expect the majority of them to go insane or die or both.<br /> <br /> 2:] <b>Guilt</b>: If you tear up a six year old, you may feel compelled to try to &quot;make it right&quot; and no doubt will make things much-much worse.<br /> <br /> 3:] <b>Weird Family Thing</b>: This is probably out of a desire to perhaps recapture something from your life and undoubtedly is the source of Wednesday Addams types.<br /> <br /> I doubt most Princes give permission to Embrace children as a general rule and I suspect most Barons are similarly inclined to think it's fucked up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T01:34:38-07:00","id":1463390,"title":"","content":"Don't forget that this may not apply to Elders, the age of Majority was different depending on time and place (medieval England had female Majority at 14 while males were either 16 or 21, depending on certain factors) I don't know about other countries and cultures, but what was considered adult has changed though time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T01:50:07-07:00","id":1463393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463390#post1463390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Don't forget that this may not apply to Elders, the age of Majority was different depending on time and place (medieval England had female Majority at 14 while males were either 16 or 21, depending on certain factors) I don't know about other countries and cultures, but what was considered adult has changed though time.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's also an issue that vampirism does seem to change you.<br /> <br /> Lucita for example doesn't remotely seem to look 17 and is taken as an international playgirl by most mortals.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T01:55:03-07:00","id":1463394,"title":"","content":"To take a different approach: in human cultures there's a general loose correlation between rate of child mortality and younger ages of adulthood. Or in other words, the worse health care is for pregnant women and infants, the younger the age of when those children that do make it past certain benchmarks are expected to take on serious responsibilities in their communities. Conversely, the better the healthcare, the older it is until cultural adulthood sets in.<br /> <br /> So, to me, a sire's ideal age for Embrace is going to vary depending on what culture they were born into, and how much they've had to change or adapt to the current culture they exist in. Clan is, of course, also going to impact things. Toreador are more likely to have an idea of when the human form is at its peak beauty, which tends to trend younger in most cultures (esp. for women), while the Tremere's studious side will trend older to ensure a potential Embrace is someone suited to the Clan's academic leanings.<br /> <br /> Sires born within the past century in Western societies (or just more adept at cultural adaptation ones) are unlikely to Embrace younger than low 20s. A Methuselah from the right time period that has long since stopped trying to change their ways every few decades might think nothing of Embracing between 15-18.<br /> <br /> That said, I would assume that anything younger falls into the Interview with a Vampire narrative on Embracing children: it happens, but only because vamprism doesn't cure stupid. Even the Sabbat would be uninterested in Embracing before puberty has had a chance to really set in in most places because there's little positives even by their twisted standards to it.<br /> <br /> I would imagine the most common form of young even by differing culture standards Embraces are going to be what CT listed as #3, and in modern nights mostly among the Anarchs and Autarkis. Something I believe got into my head because of one of the HtR books, was a mother that was Embrace by a sire that didn't realize she was still nursing her child, and she in turn Embraced her biological child in a deluded idea that should couldn't properly care for a baby with a vampire body (also keeping in mind this would have been written two decades ago, so things like shopping for formula and diapers at night wasn't as easily resolved as just having Amazon deliver). To me that's more emotionally compelling than Louis turning Claudia out of pity but damning her to a torturous existence instead of letting her die instead.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T01:56:05-07:00","id":1463395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463393#post1463393\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There's also an issue that vampirism does seem to change you.<br /> <br /> Lucita for example doesn't remotely seem to look 17 and is taken as an international playgirl by most mortals.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, there's also access to Obfuscate or Fleshcrafting to consider in that regard.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T02:08:56-07:00","id":1463398,"title":"","content":"I honestly think a lot of the franchise NPC's over the years have been given a kind of creative anachronism approach to how their age is depicted in order to avoid it being gross.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T02:22:41-07:00","id":1463400,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reasor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463398#post1463398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I honestly think a lot of the franchise NPC's over the years have been given a kind of creative anachronism approach to how their age is depicted in order to avoid it being gross.</div> </div> </div> </div>That could ignoring lore or Interview with a Vampiring it. While Claudia stayed the same general age, they all changed tremendously in appearance to being inhumanly beautiful and unrecognizable to their mortal selves.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T05:13:46-07:00","id":1463415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463400#post1463400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That could ignoring lore or Interview with a Vampiring it. While Claudia stayed the same general age, they all changed tremendously in appearance to being inhumanly beautiful and unrecognizable to their mortal selves.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> also inhuman stat levels and Disciplines, as well as path auras would manifest, moving with grace that triggers the 'uncanny valley' reaction, and self confidence and charisma can 'age' people by confusing what the brain is looking for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T06:09:24-07:00","id":1463417,"title":"","content":"I would assume younger embraces occur most often among clans with mystical/magical proclivities in order to capture that certain awareness children seem to have (especially in fantasy settings). Among these clans, (Tremere, Tzimisce, etc) size and appearance matter less than aptitude and potential. <br /> <br /> I would also assume children-sized to teen vampires are sadly not too rare among Toreador and Brujah...and even more sadly and perhaps less rarely, Gangrel and Nosferatu. <br /> <br /> Overall, probably pretty rare to encounter, but not so rare as to be shocking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24351-garygeneric","name":"Garygeneric","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T07:05:17-07:00","id":1463420,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463400#post1463400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That could ignoring lore or Interview with a Vampiring it. While Claudia stayed the same general age, they all changed tremendously in appearance to being inhumanly beautiful and unrecognizable to their mortal selves.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, Brad Pitt and Tom Cruise are already inhumanly beautiful...<br /> <br /> Overall I imagine that more modern vampires tend not to embrace people before they're about 18 or so. Much older vampires may have somewhat different and outdated ideas on what a reasonable adult age would be, but even then I imagine you'd rarely see people embraced younger than 14. While it might happen that someone younger was embraced it probably would not be a planned or intentional embrace and would rather be something done on the spur of the moment thing (maybe someone young that the vampire likes is in a freak accident and the vampire is left with the choice of letting them die or embracing them).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T09:04:54-07:00","id":1463427,"title":"","content":"2nd Edition had it as a flaw and explicitly said the biggest issue wasn't just the impediment it was in society but that Embracing someone before puberty left them emotionally and physically unprepared for the Beast.<br /> <br /> Well, moreso than usual.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T09:42:44-07:00","id":1463430,"title":"","content":"As others have said, it will depend on many things.<br /> <br /> A word of caution though - child vampires, either as NPCs or Player Characters, have a high chance of becoming cringe-inducing really quickly and making people uncomfortable. Vampire often deals with some very adult themes, and even if the character is old in years, if they are in a child/teen body, it runs the risk of very quickly going way too far for many people's comfort.<br /> <br /> So for that reason alone, I would find every thematic/story reason to make them rare.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26904-breggie","name":"breggie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26904_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T09:52:05-07:00","id":1463431,"title":"","content":"I would say they are fairly uncommon overall. I don't think 16+ presents too many problems, and as others have said different eras and cultures have different attitudes as to what constitutes the age of majority. But when you get younger than that, especially pre-puberty, I think you run into some practical issues, many of which Anne Rice addressed in Interview.<br /> <br /> We know that there are some children vampires in the setting. Chicago By Night gave us the example of Nicolai, Walenski siblings, and Damien (and others?) at the very beginning of the game. And for reasons already stated, I think many members of the Sabbat would embrace the very young out of a sense of perverse evil.<br /> <br /> The big problem with child vampires is that many will feel they have lost something by not being allowed to grow up and become resentful (either as a life experience or not having an adult body once their mind matures). And before they are able to grow their vampire Disciplines, they will be at a great physical disadvantage to any potential enemy. Another is that there will likely be many Kindred who instinctively dislike the idea and will figure out ways to purge them when young. I imagine most child vampires do not last long with a higher than average destruction rate for neonates. But if one lasts long enough to reach Ancilla age, at that point their survival rate is the same as their peers.<br /> <br /> One possibility is that in the Camarilla, certain Conclaves might have banned the embrace of children under a certain age (not necessarily 18) and become binding in certain domains. Although it certainly would not be universal policy in the Camarilla. Since we're never given much information on Conclaves and their roles in Camarilla governance, we don't know to what extent they act as law in individual domains. But in my head, I imagine that Conclaves must cover a certain amount of territory that in some ways affects certain domains of Princes. It is possible the Justicar makes an announcement to that affect, and the exact range of territory is something that is done by custom.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","user":"Black Fox","date":". 10-12-2021, 02:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-11T13:03:29-07:00","id":1463455,"title":"","content":"Thanks for all the input. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> In a chronicle I run a pair of fledgling who were embraced at age 15 have run into another NPC who was embraced at age 18. It is making them think and ask questions of their guardian/sire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":490,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","user":"omenseer","date":". 10-11-2021, 04:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T01:42:45-07:00","id":1463557,"title":"","content":"One minor thing: 18 is an arbitrary cut off point. Some folks look like they've finished puberty at 14 and are a ready adult, some people in their 20's look like they haven't finished yet. Many elders/ancilae/vampires from the &quot;less developed&quot; world are probably going to see people as &quot;adults&quot; at 16 (though of course, you're all newborns until you're a hundred /VampireLogic.)<br /> <br /> If a 15yo Looks the part. (we probably all had that one kid in class that did) he's fine<br /> <br /> One thing of note is the Camarilla and their preoccupation with the masquerade. A kid is a masquerade risk by virtue of just how much they're expected to change each year. If an adult doesn't change how he looks in a decade he's lucky, rather than a freak of nature. Adults tend not to stand out and Most people aren't going to be around long enough to really see an issue. , if a kid doesn't change in a year, nevermind a decade, then something is very wrong. Parents have a tendancy of noting the faces of all the local kids, they're easier to remember because there's just so many variables with how they look. Unless a child-vampire is an obfuscate vampire, they need to be put down for the good of the masquerade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 10-12-2021, 04:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T13:27:46-07:00","id":1463611,"title":"","content":"I actually have a differing opinion on this regard. I don't think 20-30 would be a modern standard, I think it would be general.<br /> <br /> The age of adulthood changes with times and cultures, although in more complex ways than just adjusting the arbitrary threshold. But the Embrace isn't about getting an adult, it is about getting a proper candidate for immortality.<br /> <br /> Human development don't really change that much with time (except for the average age of start of the menstrual cycle). No matter where or when you live, turning to adulthood sill have you considered young. You're ready to take on responsibilities, you're not expected to be particularly good at them. Your body won't finish growing up until about your 20th birthday, and even then you're not at your peak, which is around 30yo.<br /> <br /> Such development stages aren't clearly defined but are well known. A young warrior at 18 is expected to challenge another at 26, but just because he's young and stupid. The young maiden is beautiful, but the almost 30 matron is in the prime of her mind and skills, and just physically superior, give or take a few exceptions. The young adult is ready to start their life, but have nothing to show off yet. Is it really the age you want to lock someone up in eternity? Is it the person you want to be an immortal?<br /> <br /> My personal take is that Kindred wisdom would be to take someone at a more mature age whenever possible. Exceptions abound and are tolerated, but they're not a rule after all. Passionate Embraces are the most likely to result in vampires below 25, and sure, then the adult age for local culture will dictate how this is received by the larger vampiric society. But &quot;good&quot; Embraces are generally of people between 25-35. Women are probably Embraced younger, but not by much when vampires can stave off the effects of time on mortals through other means.<br /> <br /> Ghouling stops aging for a month, but I rule in that the healing effects of the Blood are enough for a pre-industrial woman to keep her natural youth by being Ghouled only once or twice a year without withholding her entire physical and mental development. Of course, make what you will of her mental health with such arrangement. And this definitely happens to young boys, too. So the difference in age probably isn't that much among sexes for what would be considered a good Embrace.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T13:37:05-07:00","id":1463613,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463427#post1463427\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2nd Edition had it as a flaw and explicitly said the biggest issue wasn't just the impediment it was in society but that Embracing someone before puberty left them emotionally and physically unprepared for the Beast.<br /> <br /> Well, moreso than usual.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think we can take that as borne out by events in the metaplot. If Velya the Flayer couldn't effectively prepare his childe to resist falling to the Beast, what chance would most other sires have?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T13:49:24-07:00","id":1463615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463613#post1463613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think we can take that as borne out by events in the metaplot. If Velya the Flayer couldn't effectively prepare his childe to resist falling to the Beast, what chance would most other sires have?</div> </div> </div> </div>Never embrace for love. Especially when they're a psychotic demon child.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-12-2021, 10:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T14:38:06-07:00","id":1463622,"title":"","content":"Something that doesn't seem to be considered is the notion of night and sleep when it comes to under age embraces. Anything say 12 or under regardless of society would raise red flags for not being in bed and asleep. In first world countries parents are told to get their offspring into bed by 9 o'clock, while in third world countries the children are out cold a couple hours earlier since they are already being used for manual labor, probably on the family farm. A documentary on the american dust bowl back in the 1930's had a wonderful quote about children, &quot;an exhausted child is a well behaved child&quot;. I can personally attest to the efficacy such approach.<br /> <br /> So that just leaves 13 - 17 year olds and then you are back in the normal embrace age range. Though to be fair, if the game had to confront the reality of how embracing would work, no one below the age of 20 would probably be considered. As much as vampire fluff is all about gothic love and tragedy, the reality is that vampire clans would treat embracing like how players treat hiring NPCs in a video game. They probably pay attention to their stats and what they can bring to the table first, then their aesthetics a distant second.<br /> <br /> Sure there will be the occasional wierdo who just really wants a certain scheme or concept, but truth be told, a person who would put that together in the first place probably wouldn't be embraced to begin with.<br /> <br /> So that just leaves the ethics argument for those who accidentally killed a kid, but the act of embracing at that point is less about undoing a wrong and more about assuaging their own guilt. Regardless it would be incredibly rare.<br /> <br /> In all likelihood there would be probably be a higher occurrence of Malkavians or deranged members of other clans with Obfuscate who use the power to portray themselves as child vampires, rather than actual children being embraced.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T15:01:55-07:00","id":1463627,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463622#post1463622\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Something that doesn't seem to be considered is the notion of night and sleep when it comes to under age embraces. Anything say 12 or under regardless of society would raise red flags for not being in bed and asleep. In first world countries parents are told to get their offspring into bed by 9 o'clock, while in third world countries the children are out cold a couple hours earlier since they are already being used for manual labor, probably on the family farm. A documentary on the american dust bowl back in the 1930's had a wonderful quote about children, &quot;an exhausted child is a well behaved child&quot;. I can personally attest to the efficacy such approach.<br /> <br /> So that just leaves 13 - 17 year olds and then you are back in the normal embrace age range. Though to be fair, if the game had to confront the reality of how embracing would work, no one below the age of 20 would probably be considered. As much as vampire fluff is all about gothic love and tragedy, the reality is that vampire clans would treat embracing like how players treat hiring NPCs in a video game. They probably pay attention to their stats and what they can bring to the table first, then their aesthetics a distant second.<br /> <br /> Sure there will be the occasional wierdo who just really wants a certain scheme or concept, but truth be told, a person who would put that together in the first place probably wouldn't be embraced to begin with.<br /> <br /> So that just leaves the ethics argument for those who accidentally killed a kid, but the act of embracing at that point is less about undoing a wrong and more about assuaging their own guilt. Regardless it would be incredibly rare.<br /> <br /> In all likelihood there would be probably be a higher occurrence of Malkavians or deranged members of other clans with Obfuscate who use the power to portray themselves as child vampires, rather than actual children being embraced.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, none of that is something that vampire children haven't dealt with before.<br /> <br /> <b>Tips for success as a vampire child</b><br /> <br /> * Have a ghoul or other slave to serve as your guardian and question parenting.<br /> * Obfuscate is useful to make sure that no one pays attention to you or creating a fake adult persona at stronger levels.<br /> * Dominate is important.<br /> * Protean might also be useful if you can get it.<br /> * So is Presence.<br /> * If you're able to do it, get a doctor to state that you have a medical condition where you don't physically age but are an adult.<br /> * Vicissitude is a crapshot as you need to meet a Tzimisce who won't make you a lamp or &quot;his&quot; idea of an adult.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T18:46:16-07:00","id":1463637,"title":"","content":"A friend of mine once played as a ghoul character who was the father and caretaker of an essentially non-sentient infant vampire (delivered posthumously after the mother's failed embrace, I believe). It was seriously messed up, but he was the best roleplayer in our group and enjoyed the challenge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T23:44:45-07:00","id":1463656,"title":"","content":"I'm surprised that &quot;1st world/3rd world&quot; is still being used in 2021, even with quotes around it. despite it being obvious cold war propaganda and not making any internal sense besides alluding to first-rate ,second-rate, third rate... <br /> <br /> Also the USA exhibits almost every symptom of a developing country despite being rich and powerful. High religiosity, low worker protections, huge wealth gaps, low government transparency... If it weren't for an aging population, it'd have every symptom. <br /> <br /> In any case, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5826_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5826\" data-vbnamecard=\"5826\">monteparnas</a> , you're underestimating the sheer amount of youth in the medieval period. While death rates are exaggerated, the fact is that there were a lot of kids at the time trying to make up for it (and adding to it significantly) Youths would outnumber adults in a lot of areas. People tried for a lot of kids. Kids and Teens were abundant both on streets and farms. For every mother that died of childbirth there'd be maybe ten more churning out eight kids. I don't think most vampires ever thought this would change, so embracing under 20's probably seemed just as viable, if not moreso, than embracing above 20's during the time. That's a massive change from europe now where around half the population seems to be above 50.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T23:46:22-07:00","id":1463657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463656#post1463656\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm surprised that &quot;1st world/3rd world&quot; is still being used in 2021, even with quotes around it. despite it being obvious cold war propaganda and not making any internal sense besides alluding to first-rate ,second-rate, third rate...</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought it meant:<br /> <br /> * Allied with the West<br /> * Allied with the Soviet Union<br /> * Unaligned<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-13-2021, 02:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-13T00:33:44-07:00","id":1463659,"title":"","content":"Explicitly, yes, but implicitly, it's suggestive of superiority.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-13T00:47:50-07:00","id":1463660,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463656#post1463656\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm surprised that &amp;quot;1st world/3rd world&amp;quot; is still being used in 2021, even with quotes around it. despite it being obvious cold war propaganda and not making any internal sense besides alluding to first-rate ,second-rate, third rate...</div> </div> </div> </div>I frequently see people who were too young for (or not alive during) the Cold War who don't really know what the phrases mean(t) and instead use 1st/3rd world as a shorthand for &quot;developed&quot; (US, Europe, etc) and &quot;undeveloped&quot; (South America, Africa, etc) parts of the world with coterminous ideas about mitary, and technological power. You also see that version of the words get used by people outside of the US. <br /> <br /> I have friends from India and it isn't uncommon to hear more nationalist politicians and members of the media there discuss how they want India to become a &quot;first world power.&quot; When they use that phrase they don't mean in the Cold War sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-13T00:52:56-07:00","id":1463661,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thoth</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I never mentioned abuse, I mentioned societal norms. I have been to other countries, I started work in the family business before I was five years old. Perhaps you should take your own advice about making statements.</div> </div> </div> </div>And societal norms aren't equal everywhere just because of economical development. Your experience doesn't prove that your broad statement is real, it proves that you lived in one region of one country where this was ok. And I used &quot;abuse&quot; in very strict terms, that is, Brazilian law.<br /> <br /> To Brazilian law, that is just one example of a thing that exists in a &quot;third world&quot; (I hate this term) country, what happened to you is abuse. Our social norms generally approach this, but it ultimately depends on many factors like urbanization of the area and local culture, as it isn't equal everywhere, and in rural areas there are a number of people that would thing it ok to have a five years old working, but even in rural areas a lot would have a somewhat higher bar. And in cities, because we're not only farmland just because we're a &quot;developing country&quot; (better, not there yet), this is unthinkable.<br /> <br /> On the US, by the way, what happened to you is permitted by law and happens. US law allows children to work on family small farms and family business, in media or doing house chores at any age whatsoever, and on anyone's farm for short harvest from age 10, or indefinitely out of school hours from age 12. From 14 they don't need parental permission and can work at anything non-hazardous, at 16 they can ditch school to work. Few states have more strict laws, while others are exempt from even federal minimum.<br /> <br /> Brazil have among the stricter laws on the matter. No work is permitted below 14, period. At 14 you can work as an Apprentice, a condition tightly regulated that requires approval from and good performance at school, among several rules and limitations. At 16 you can work non-hazardous day jobs, but your employee is still required to make sure you're going to school regularly.<br /> <br /> Not that the US is the prime example on labor laws, Brazil is a typical case for developing countries, or that laws translate perfectly to societal norms. But laws are an indication of overall expectation in a country, they may be more or less followed, more or less ignored, but they're there for a reason. And looking at a broader (if not so detailed) data on as many countries as possible there are some striking trends.<br /> <br /> Most countries set the minimum work age between 14 or 16. 13 is uncommon, but is there, while 12 is a rare outlier. Some have laws for work exempt from minimum age, but this work is almost always restricted to media work under strict control and regulated hours. A few allow unrestricted work below 16, but on every continent without exception the most common age for unrestricted labor is 18, with some countries setting it even higher.<br /> <br /> What's more, there are few rules to determine who will be the exceptions to the trends. Work at 13? Is allowed on Kenya, Turkey, Switzerland and United Kingdom. When unrestricted labor is allowed? 16 in Egypt, but 19 in Morocco, 15 in Turkey, but 21 in Iran. Are the laws followed? What matters is that if they're there, at least a sizable portion of population think they are sensible rules, enough for local legislators to not feel enough pressure to change them yet. Societal rules may be different, but they're likely to vary depending on specific circumstances and not on a generalized standard all around the country, much less among all countries.<br /> <br /> So despite your experience, your broad non backed statement remain a broad non backed statement that further misconceptions.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463656#post1463656\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm surprised that &quot;1st world/3rd world&quot; is still being used in 2021, even with quotes around it. despite it being obvious cold war propaganda and not making any internal sense besides alluding to first-rate ,second-rate, third rate...</div> </div> </div> </div>That's why I put it between &quot;&quot; and personally hate those terms.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463656#post1463656\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also the USA exhibits almost every symptom of a developing country despite being rich and powerful. High religiosity, low worker protections, huge wealth gaps, low government transparency... If it weren't for an aging population, it'd have every symptom.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately for all of us that's true, and in some areas it is worse. Namely, labor laws and health access.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463656#post1463656\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In any case, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5826_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5826\" data-vbnamecard=\"5826\">monteparnas</a> , you're underestimating the sheer amount of youth in the medieval period.</div> </div> </div> </div>Believe me, I know and I gave it a lot of thought.<br /> <br /> The thing is, the Age Pyramid was reasonably stable between 15 and 40. You have a lot of youths, but people who reached what we consider adulthood today were likely to survive at least some more decades at least. In its time as a kingdom, under far more adult mortality than the Middle Ages, Rome still had enough to form a Senatus of 100 elders with a minimum of 60 years. It declined with time, but by the time of Caesar Augustus a 32 minimum still allowed steep competition to be a part of a 600 members institution.<br /> <br /> Assuming a calculated Embrace, why would a vampire have a lesser threshold than mortal institutions? Youths are abundant, sure, but is this about abundance? A young adult have little to offer, and if one shows promise you have time to observe and intervene as you see fit. Mortals have to produce as many children as possible in the shortest amount of time, but a vampire need to prospect carefully and can easily take 5, 10 years to chose, as this will be a big investment. If you want you can just kidnap the mortal and start educating your future childe, and still give them time to physically develop. Why be in such a rush?<br /> <br /> I think it is even the case that Embracing youths would be a problem precisely because of how having children was important for medieval economy. The sooner you take a mortal to unlife, the less this mortal contributes to human procreation, which only weakens your domain and herd.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463657#post1463657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I thought it meant:<br /> <br /> * Allied with the West<br /> * Allied with the Soviet Union<br /> * Unaligned</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope, relatively few countries were really unaligned at the time. It had also a lot to do with being strong enough to stay firmly at one side or too weak to keep them from interfering with local politics.<br /> <br /> I give our example, Brazil was aligned with the US through most of it, but both sides intervened by financing political parties and clandestine militia through their spy networks. The US got us a military coup and dictatorship (already confirmed by leaked documents, thanks WikiLeaks) in the 1st of April 1964 (even today our military deny the date and say it was the previous day because they don't like to say it was in April's Fools, known here as Dia da Mentira, Lie's Day). We got to be firmly US allies for the rest of the Cold War.<br /> <br /> That was the trend everywhere, 3rd World meant a place that could and should be disputed by intervention instead of them expecting independent allegiance, but most of those countries ended up at one side or another anyway. The Red Fear was a thing here all the same, and it even made a return in the last years.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1463381-18-and-under-embraces-how-frequent-are-they?p=1463660#post1463660\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have friends from India and it isn't uncommon to hear more nationalist politicians and members of the media there discuss how they want India to become a &quot;first world power.&quot; When they use that phrase they don't mean in the Cold War sense.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is also common around here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-13T07:58:20-07:00","id":1463704,"title":"","content":"I live in Appalachia, in the USA, and I know a number of families that own farms and where the kids spend a lot of their days working on the family farms. That is neither here nor there, just a little statement regarding kids on farms.<br /> <br /> In any case, in most nations, little kids wandering around by themselves at night is seen as unusual. Even taking you kids to Waffle House past most people's bedtimes can get the occasional strange look, or going somewhere with your kids during school hours, though vampires don't need to worry about that. This doesn't mean that the police will be called on child vampires who are out late at night, but people tend to notice little kids more, especially in situations where they don't expect to see them. This makes things more dangerous for child vampires in many ways. I suppose, on the flip side, kids are less likely to be suspected of crimes, but if the police want to take an unaccompanied minor into custody then that will be a major problem even if they don't intend on charging them with crimes.<br /> <br /> Keep in mind that in the Camarilla every embrace must have the permission of the prince and an embrace without permission can potentially lead to execution for both sire and childe. For this reason, embraces of passion are going to be rarer and those that happen are more likely to end up in the death of the childe. Because each embrace requires permission, then it is unlikely that obvious minor children are going to get the embrace. Even if a potential sire really wants it, its highly unlikely that the prince would grant permission for this with all of the additional disadvantages and Masquerade risks that a child vampire presents. Even if some minor shows really great potential for the embrace, it's highly likely that the vampire would just wait until that child grew to their late teens, a very short amount of time by vampire standards.<br /> <br /> What if there is an urgent reason to embrace a kid? Let's say that the local Tremere discover a 10 year old kid with amazing magical potential, whose magical talent would make them a nature at Thaumaturgy - but this child has terminal cancer that will kill them within a year and no amount of vampire blood or Thaumaturgical rituals will cure or slow the progress of the cancer, so the kid needs to be embraced to preserve their magical talent. Would the prince grant permission in that case? It depends, but even if the prince doesn't, the Tremere could take the child to another location with a friendly prince or none at all to avoid that rule.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-13T12:45:31-07:00","id":1463741,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>That was a personal attack,</b></span> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar727_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"727\" data-vbnamecard=\"727\">Thoth</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07